            <ArticleTitle>Effect of preoperative statin therapy and cardiac outcomes after coronary artery bypass grafting.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1128-30, A6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Preoperative statin administration in this analysis showed improved cardiovascular outcomes after coronary artery bypass graft surgery, including death, myocardial infarction, unstable angina, and arrhythmias.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
